{"id":5769,"date":"2019-05-02T14:00:14","date_gmt":"2019-05-02T18:00:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=5769"},"modified":"2019-05-02T14:00:21","modified_gmt":"2019-05-02T18:00:21","slug":"rodeo-pool-cues-really","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2019\/05\/02\/rodeo-pool-cues-really\/","title":{"rendered":"Rodeo &#038; Pool Cues? Really?"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>There was a nasty winter storm coming in, so as we traveled we decided we had better find a place to park that had reliable electric, water, and sewer.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We really appreciated the hospitality of our new friend Kevin allowing us to park at his <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2019\/04\/11\/camping-at-school\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"110 year old schoolhouse at Hinkley, Utah (opens in a new tab)\">110 year old schoolhouse at Hinkley, Utah<\/a> but with the storm heading our way, we would be a lot more comfortable with a full hook-up site.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We decided to skip the Elks Lodge in Salt Lake City and keep heading up I-15, take I-80 east and on into Rock Springs, Wyoming.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Rock Springs offered us the Sweetwater Events Complex (which is also the Sweetwater County Fairgrounds) and they have 1200 full hook-up sites and offer Escapee RV Club members a 25% discount on camping fees.  We were glad to have outrun the storm and ready to hunker down for 2 or 3 days.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"304\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190410_084009.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5770\" class=\"wp-image-5770\"\/><figcaption>Heavy wet snow on the mirror<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190409143902.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5771\" class=\"wp-image-5771\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190409143902.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190409143902-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190409143902-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190409143902-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190409143902-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190409143902-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption>We are nearly the only ones here<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/Big-White-Flakes.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5772\" class=\"wp-image-5772\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/Big-White-Flakes.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/Big-White-Flakes-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/Big-White-Flakes-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/Big-White-Flakes-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/Big-White-Flakes-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/Big-White-Flakes-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>More snow on the car<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>We made it just in time.  1200 spots, only about 4 or 5 others occupied &#8230; and the slushy snow started coming down.  We were glad to be off the road safe and dry.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Our Escapees RV Club is having their annual &#8220;Escapade&#8221; at Rock Springs in June of 2020, so we decided to give our club members (via Facebook) a little early invite!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video height=\"1080\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1920 \/ 1080;\" width=\"1920\" controls src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190409_163857.mp4\"><\/video><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>As the afternoon and evening went on, we saw more and more other &#8220;campers&#8221; coming in.  At first I thought everyone was just trying to get off the road, but I quickly realized these were nearly all horse trailers.  By the next morning, we were surrounded by lots of families in their &#8220;horse RV&#8217;s&#8221;.  These rigs were BIG and had plenty of room for maybe a half dozen horses, a tack room, and living quarters for the family.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_112940.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5775\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_112940.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_112940-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_112940-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_112940-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_112940-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_112940-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>The next morning we found ourselves surrounded by horse trailers<br><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>As it turned out, this Friday Saturday and Sunday was a youth rodeo.  In this part of the country, the kids go to school four days a week and Friday and the weekends are reserved for rodeo and work on the family farm\/ranch.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_112845.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5784\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_112845.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_112845-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_112845-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_112845-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_112845-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_112845-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>We went on in to the arena to see the kids compete.  They&#8217;re all timed and judged on technique.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video height=\"720\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1280 \/ 720;\" width=\"1280\" controls src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_103204.mp4\"><\/video><figcaption>One of the contestants gives it a try<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video height=\"720\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1280 \/ 720;\" width=\"1280\" controls src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190412_104236.mp4\"><\/video><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The other interesting event going on there was a 3 day pool tournament.  I&#8217;ve never given this sport a thought I guess &#8230; and when I finally did think about it, I figured pool players were probably bar patrons that just play pool for something social to do at the local bar.  But evidently, it&#8217;s a big thing in Wyoming!  I asked if this was a regional or state-wide tournament and the response was &#8220;no &#8211; it&#8217;s just a local thing&#8221;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_100825.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5782\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_100825.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_100825-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_100825-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_100825-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_100825-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190412_100825-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Yes, that&#8217;s 48 pool tables!<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>We were fascinated by the fact that they bring in <em>FORTY-EIGHT<\/em> pool tables for this 3 day event &#8211; and I&#8217;m guessing pool tables are certainly not easy to transport, assemble, and level!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>But the really wonderful part of this stay was the new friends we made.  When we were at Ruby&#8217;s Campground at Bryce Canyon we met (online via <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rvillage.com\/home\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"RVillage.com (opens in a new tab)\">RVillage.com<\/a>) other campers Mike and Judy.  We had just checked in at Bryce and they were just heading out.  We talked about our travel plans and it seemed we were pretty much on the same path.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>When we pulled in to Sweetwater \/ Rock Springs Mike and Judy were already there!  We walked on over to their rig and had a nice visit at their place that afternoon, staying inside in the warmth and out of the rain and slush<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The next day the four of us climbed in our car and made a &#8220;road trip&#8221; to <a href=\"https:\/\/utah.com\/flaming-gorge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"Flaming Gorge Reservoir and Dam (opens in a new tab)\">Flaming Gorge Reservoir and Dam<\/a>.  We saw a lot of beautiful country, learned a little about each other and our families and had a lot of laughs during the drive and over lunch at a local cafe.  Mike and Judy are also full-time RV&#8217;ers, originally from Florida and have been on the road just about the same amount of time as we have.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Clicking on any of the smaller thumbnail images will always bring up a larger view.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_113313-1.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5786\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5786\" class=\"wp-image-5786\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_113313-1.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_113313-1-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_113313-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_113313-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_113313-1-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_113313-1-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Our new friends Mike &amp; Judy<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_124747.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5787\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5787\" class=\"wp-image-5787\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_124747.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_124747-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_124747-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_124747-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_124747-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_124747-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Flaming Gorge Dam<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_141546.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5788\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5788\" class=\"wp-image-5788\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_141546.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_141546-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_141546-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_141546-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_141546-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_141546-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>These guys were at the table next to us at the restaurant<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_142521.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5789\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5789\" class=\"wp-image-5789\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_142521.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_142521-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_142521-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_142521-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_142521-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411_142521-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Our lunch stop restaurant<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411104918.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5790\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5790\" class=\"wp-image-5790\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411104918.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411104918-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411104918-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411104918-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411104918-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411104918-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411105333.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5791\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5791\" class=\"wp-image-5791\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411105333.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411105333-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411105333-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411105333-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411105333-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411105333-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411112956.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5792\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5792\" class=\"wp-image-5792\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411112956.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411112956-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411112956-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411112956-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411112956-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411112956-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption>A roadside overlook<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411115416.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5793\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5793\" class=\"wp-image-5793\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411115416.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411115416-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411115416-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411115416-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411115416-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411115416-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption>Flaming Gorge Dam<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411115428-1.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5794\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5794\" class=\"wp-image-5794\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411115428-1.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411115428-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411115428-1-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411115428-1-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411115428-1-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411115428-1-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption>Judy just had to taste the snow (they&#8217;re from Florida)<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411135037.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5795\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5795\" class=\"wp-image-5795\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411135037.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411135037-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411135037-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411135037-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411135037-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/20190411135037-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption>Is this an awesome view or what?<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>After the 3rd night at Rock Springs, we decided the roads were clear and dry so we continued our trek north and east toward Fort Peck, Montana.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">AND THEN TRAGEDY STRUCK!<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Our next stop for the night was to be Kaycee, Wyoming.  We were running low on fuel, so we stopped in to Flying J Travel Center at Rawlins, Wyoming.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"338\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/RawlinsWYMap.jpg?fit=685%2C304&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5805\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/RawlinsWYMap.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/RawlinsWYMap-300x133.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/RawlinsWYMap-768x341.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/RawlinsWYMap-1024x455.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/RawlinsWYMap-685x304.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Our stop for diesel fuel at Rawlins Wyoming (south of Casper)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>After we filled with diesel (and propane), time to turn the key and move on north &#8230; and crap!  Crank crank crank &#8230;. but no ignition.  A sinking feeling came over me &#8211; what could it be?  It&#8217;s a diesel so I know there&#8217;s no spark to be concerned about .. no ignition coil &#8230; no spark plugs or wires, but it could be a fuel pump .. or something a whole lot worse.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We have emergency roadside assistance through FMCA, Escapees, and CoachNet but we were stuck here blocking the pumps and I really wanted to get help soon so we could get a diagnosis and hopefully continue moving on down the road.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Right next door to Flying J was a truck\/auto repair shop called &#8220;<a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"Boss Shop (opens in a new tab)\" href=\"https:\/\/bosstruckshops.com\/\" target=\"_blank\">Boss Shop<\/a>&#8220;.  I walked on over and even though their mechanic was in the middle of another job, he was kind enough to take the time and walk on over to our place to check it out.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>He determined it was indeed not getting any fuel and went back to the shop to get a new <a href=\"https:\/\/amzn.to\/2V8wHke\">replacement fuel filter \/ water separator<\/a>.  He (Jamesen) was back in record time, and replaced the <a href=\"https:\/\/amzn.to\/2V8wHke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"filter (opens in a new tab)\">filter<\/a>.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>I had to crank the engine quite a bit to get the fuel line primed as our 2002 engine has a mechanical fuel pump whereas the newer diesel engines utilize an electrical fuel pump &#8211; which would only necessitate turning the key &#8220;on&#8221; to energize the pump.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190413_123722.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5806\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190413_123722.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190413_123722-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190413_123722-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190413_123722-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190413_123722-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190413_123722-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>My new Best Friend Diesel Mechanic Jamesen (also known as JT)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>So although we had another &#8220;bump in the road&#8221;, we were saved by the good work and kindness of others and were quickly heading further north.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Stay tuned for our next post &#8220;A Sleepy Little Town&#8221;.  Thanks for riding along and we invite your comments down the page.  See you next time!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-subscriptions\">[jetpack_subscription_form show_only_email_and_button=&#8221;true&#8221; custom_background_button_color=&#8221;undefined&#8221; custom_text_button_color=&#8221;undefined&#8221; submit_button_text=&#8221;Subscribe&#8221; submit_button_classes=&#8221;undefined&#8221; show_subscribers_total=&#8221;true&#8221; ]<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>There was a nasty winter storm coming in, so as we traveled we decided we had better find a place to park that had reliable electric, water, and sewer. We really appreciated the hospitality of our new friend Kevin allowing us to park at his 110 year old schoolhouse at Hinkley, Utah but with the &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2019\/05\/02\/rodeo-pool-cues-really\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Rodeo &#038; Pool Cues? Really?<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[554707329],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5769","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-traveling"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5769","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5769"}],"version-history":[{"count":17,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5769\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5813,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5769\/revisions\/5813"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5769"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=5769"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=5769"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}